VERSION 2
RULE injection.sql VERSION 1
IN DATA_FLOW
LET input BE VARIABLE MATCHES input.untrusted
LET sink BE CALL MATCHES sql.execution
WHEN input FLOWS TO sink
REQUIRE NOT sanitizer.sql-parameterization input
REQUIRE NOT sanitizer.sql-numeric input
REPORT "SQL Injection Review"
SEVERITY CRITICAL
CONFIDENCE FROM EVIDENCE
WITH TRACE
